{{Quote|Not only can I transform into anything you can, but I can also evolve those creatures to their Ultimate form.|[[Albedo]], describing the Ultimate forms to [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]].<ref name="TFB1">''[[The Final Battle: Part 1]]''</ref>}}
'''Ultimate Forms''' are the evolved forms of various [[Ultimatrix]] aliens, used primarily by [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] in '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' and [[Albedo]] in '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]'''.

==Concept and Creation==
The evolutionary function works by placing the DNA of the selected alien in a simulated scenario, subjecting them to the worst-case scenario over millions of theoretical years in order to "force" evolution.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimates Worst Case Scenario.PNG]]|group = DM|name = scenario}} The resultant evolutionary adaptations to this simulated worst case scenario are then modified into the existing DNA of the selected alien, thus evolving it into the Ultimate form.

The method of this is the "survival of the fittest", in which simulated evolution ensures that the Ultimate forms are more combat-oriented than their normal forms. An example is [[Ultimate Humungousaur]] having his durable armor on both his head and abdomen, as well as a spiked mace at the end of his tail, which regular [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]] does not have.

The evolutionary function was added to the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] by [[Albedo]] after stealing the prototype from [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]].<ref name="TFB1" />{{Refn|group = DM|name = scenario}} When Azmuth saw the Ultimatrix for the first time, he commented that the function was "begging for trouble".<ref>''[[Map of Infinity (Episode)|Map of Infinity]]''</ref> He was proven right later when the Ultimate forms gained some sentience and planned to free themselves from the Ultimatrix against [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]].<ref name=TUS>''[[The Ultimate Sacrifice]]''</ref>

The Ultimate forms are not found within the [[Codon Stream]] because, strictly speaking, they do not exist in the [[Prime Timeline]] as a collectible species. Rather, they are by-products of pre-existing alien DNA.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimates Were Stored Locally.PNG]]|group = DM}}{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Forms Are Artificial.png]]|group = DM}}{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimates Are Not Natural Species.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

Almost any DNA can be put through the evolution process.{{Refn|[[:File:Almost All Aliens Have Ultimates.png]]|group = DJW}}

==Activation==
===Original Ultimatrix===
To activate an Ultimate form, [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] transformed into an alien and then pressed the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol (occasionally rotating it counterclockwise about 45 degrees before pressing), which resulted in four spikes protruding from the Ultimatrix diagonally. Ben was then consumed by a bright green energy field and went Ultimate.

