===[[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)]]===
To activate the Ultimate form, [[Albedo]] selects an alien and activates the transformation, just like on the original Ultimatrix. However, he is immediately transformed into the Ultimate form directly of that alien without activating them in-between regular forms. Instead of green, the light Albedo is consumed in is red.

Whereas [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] usually reserves the Ultimate feature as a last resort, Albedo seemingly replaces the devolved forms of his aliens with them in order to gain the upper hand whenever he and Ben do battle.

