==Sentient Forms==
[[File:TUS (523).png|thumb|The Sentient Forms]]
In ''[[The Ultimate Sacrifice]]'', the six Ultimate forms that [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] had used most by then gained sentience and demanded their freedom from the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]], causing Ben to eventually make the decision to sacrifice his own life to let them escape. [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] was impressed by Ben's willingness to sacrifice himself and intervened, freeing the Ultimates while simultaneously saving Ben's life after which he took the Ultimates to a world where they would be free to roam by themselves.

Azmuth prevented the recurrence of the incident by modifying the Ultimatrix in such a way that the Ultimate forms, as with their normal forms, would simply be "empty shells" occupied by Ben's mind in order to prevent them from gaining sentience.

