==Trivia==
*Some of the Ultimates have completely changed their physical appearance, while some ([[Ultimate Cannonbolt|Cannonbolt]], [[Ultimate Way Big|Way Big]], [[Ultimate Big Chill|Big Chill]], etc) simply change their color with some minor additions.
**[[Ultimate Ben]] looks identical to to his [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|regular counterpart]].
**All Ultimate forms used by Albedo in '''Omniverse''' (except Ultimate Humungousaur and Ultimate Echo Echo), have the same color scheme like his regular transformations, but their physical appearance has changed to varying degrees.
*The first time the Ultimate function was used, [[Albedo]] turned the rim of the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol, causing the core to pop out, which he promptly pressed.<ref name="TFB1" /> In some instances, Ben turned the symbol between 45 and 90 degrees counterclockwise before activating it, which doesn't activate the Ultimate function. 
**In '''Omniverse''', with his stabilizer Ultimatrix, Albedo only needs to think about transforming into an Ultimate Form.
*[[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] is a bit scared of the Ultimates the same way he used to be afraid of [[Ghostfreak]], but thinks they are cool.{{Refn|[[:File:Bellwood Population.PNG]]|group = DM}}
*Ben felt discomfort whenever going Ultimate.{{Refn|''link unavailable''|group = DM}}
*The original Ultimatrix's evolutionary feature had nothing to do with the wielder.{{Refn|[[:File:Evolutionary Featured Not Related To Wielder.PNG]]|group = DM}}
*According to [[Dwayne McDuffie]], Ben's pink eyes in ''[[Fame]]'' had a connection to the Ultimate forms,{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Pink Eyes.PNG]]|group = DM}} and there was an episode explaining them in development.{{Refn|[[:File:Glowing Eyes Episode.PNG]]|group = DM}}
**The episode's original script stated that the eyes were supposed to be red, where the pink color was a animation error.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/c/cf/Fame_Script_As_Recorded.pdf ''Fame'' Script As Recorded]|group = script}} This could link the eyes to the Sentient Forms, as Ben had red eyes when the [[Sentient Ultimate Humungousaur]] took over his mind.<ref name=TUS/>
*The evolutionary function drained the original Ultimatrix's battery quicker than regular transformations.{{Refn|[[:File:Evolutionary Feature Drained the Ultimatrix's Battery.PNG]]|group = DM}}
*Ultimate Forms could be used in an alien fusion, being a mix of the Ultimate forms of both aliens.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Fusions.png]]|group = DR}}
*It was decided from the beginning of development on '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' that the current [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] does not have an evolutionary feature.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Omnitrix No Evolutionary Function.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:OV Omnitrix No Evolutionary Function 2.png]]|group = DJW}}
**The Omnitrix is neither able to accept the evolved DNA of Ultimate forms{{Refn|''link unavailable''|group = DJW}} nor be transformed into an Ultimatrix by a [[Polymorphic Crystal]].{{Refn|[[:File:Polymorphic Crystal Will Not Turn Omnitrix Into Ultimatrix.png]]|group = DJW}} Because of these factors, Ben will never regain the ability to transform into Ultimate Forms.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Will Never Regain Ultimate Forms.png]]|group = DJW}}
***Originally the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] would have the [[Ultimate Forms]] function, while still being called the Omnitrix.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/9/92/Tangled_Web_P2_Script_Outline.pdf/revision/latest ''Tangled Web: Part 2'' Script Outline]|group = outline}}<ref>''[[Tangled Web: Part 2]]''</ref> Similarly, [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000's]] [[Omnitrix (Ultimate Alien Future)|Omnitrix]] is named Omnitrix but possesses Ultimate Forms, just as the [[Nemetrix]] does not become known as the Ultimatrix despite gaining access to Ultimate Forms.
*If [[Ben 23]] had the Ultimatrix, he would call his Ultimate forms "Monsterizer Forms".{{Refn|[[:File:Ben 23 Ultimate Forms.png]]|group = DJW}}
*The Evolutionary Function can be used on the Ultimate forms themselves for seemingly infinite times, allowing them to evolve even further so that they can adapt to the situation around them. However, the resulting evolutions may not turn out the way the Ultimatrix's user would like.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimates Can Go Ultimate.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimatrix Can Evolve Infinite Amount of Times.png]]|group = DR}}
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] loved the concept of the evolved forms of Ben's aliens, but to him, calling them "Ultimate" would mean that the Ultimate forms themselves would have to be cooler than their regular counterparts. He found this to be probably totally impossible because he felt that there was no way to make 100% of them to be cooler, but one must push an evolved form as far as they can.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's Opinion on the Ultimates' Designs.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Derrick believed that it was possible but not probable for Ultimate forms to be stronger than the [[Nemetrix]] aliens.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Aliens vs Nemetrix Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Derrick found the idea of Ultimate forms existing as natural species in alternate timelines to be interesting and believed it would be possible.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Forms as Natural Species in Alternate Timelines.png]]|group = DJW}} One notable example of such a universe is the War Universe.{{Refn|[[:File:War Universe Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Derrick oversaw the development of the Ultimate forms' designs in '''Omniverse''' from roughs to color. However, the only designs he worked on were [[Ultimate Albedo]] and some work on [[Ultimate Spidermonkey]]. As for the rest of the Ultimates featured in the show, they were designed by [[Steven Choi]] alongside [[Chap Yaep]] and Dou Hong.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's work on the Ultimate forms.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*[[Charlotte McDuffie]] likes to think the Ultimates are 10 times stronger than their regular forms.{{Refn|[[:File:Charlotte McDuffie Thinks Ultimates are 10x Stronger.png]]|group = CM}}

